msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Sega SSF/DSF Audio Decoder"
msgstr "Dekodér zvuku Sega SSF/DSF"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Sega Saturn Sound Format (SSF) and Dreamcast Sound Format (DSF) is an audio format based on PSF. It stores audio ripped from the ROMs of Sega Saturn and Sega Dreamcast games."
msgstr "Sega Saturn Sound Format (SSF) a Dreamcast Sound Format (DSF) jsou zvukové formáty založené na PSF. Ukládají zvuk extrahovaný z ROM her pro Sega Saturn a Sega Dreamcast."

